  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Menton, the most dog-friendly town in the Alpes-Maritimes when it comes to beaches, also has several hotels welcoming dogs in its centre and around Garavan. Roquebrune-Cap-Martin, right next door, rounds out the options.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>Given its proximity to the Garavan dog beach and the Golfe Bleu beach, this area is particularly handy for a seaside stay with your dog without long journeys.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the Italian border is just a few minutes from Menton — a good way to extend the exploration beyond the French Riviera.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>La Pointe des Douaniers in Cap-d'Ail, also dog-friendly, adds to the area's swimming options.</p>
